# Glint Weaver ({3} from Black Lotus plus four Moxen), with Bot2's Llanowar Elves in play too: all three counters go on the Glint Weaver
# alone, one target being enough though there is a choice (CR 601.2d), and none refused as it needs one target at least: a 6/6. "Then you gain life equal to the greatest toughness among
# creatures you control" counts after the counters (CR 608.2c): 6, not the 3 toughness it entered with (20 to 26). It has reach.

